Error [E0112]: `Cell<fn() -> Int>.get()` cannot copy its value
  --> local_cell_get_rejects_values_without_copy_semantics.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     _ :: cell.get()
    |               ^^^
 Why: `get` returns an independent owned value, so the stored type must support copying
 Fix: Use `.read(value -> ...)` to inspect it without making a copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
